"""Mainly a spelling-sensitive response to 'wait' and its word family.

Bare wait is strongest, waiting/waited weaker, and await much weaker.
Also recognize Wait split across tokens in identifiers. Smaller rules cover
hesitation ('Hmm'), commas after wait, import syntax and an initial Title:
heading. Most other tokens are near zero; document starts have a small
case/spacing-dependent offset.
